  <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">part of</rdfs:label>
  <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A core mereological relation. p part_of w if and only if p is a part of w. The inverse of has_part.</rdfs:comment>
